title Vinyl Knock-knock: the Playback page where the launcher answers screen: the Knock-knock row (last, Off) and its sentence in the strip; a tap turns it On, Enter Off again
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE playback
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1

wait 900
shot 01-playback-knock-off
expect text "Knock-knock"
expect text "Gapless"
tap "Knock-knock"
wait 400
shot 02-playback-knock-on
key enter
wait 400
shot 03-playback-knock-off-again
expect noquit
